<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2267_8597.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diennst</unclear>, unnd was wir ehren liebs
<lb n="2"/>unnd guots vermögend, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, fromm fürsichtig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> wyß,
<lb n="3"/>innsonnders guot fründt, unnd gethrüw lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habent</unclear> unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geliebter</unclear> burgermeister herr
<lb n="5"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Heinrich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Holtzhalb</unclear></persName> unnd unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethrüwer</unclear> lieb-
<lb n="6"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitrhat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seckelmeister</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hanns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Uolrich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wolff</unclear></persName> zuo
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihrer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerkhunfft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aller</unclear> notturfft nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichtet</unclear>, was
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vilfaltiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> fründtschafft unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotthetan</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffüerung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> nüwen vogts zuo <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sax</unclear></placeName> unnd
<lb n="10"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Forstegg</unclear></placeName> unnd <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sythhar</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzeigt</unclear>, sonnder ouch mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">was</unclear> Eydt-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnößischer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">antwort</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erclärung</unclear> uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevelch</unclear> by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolmeinlich</unclear> an-
<lb n="13"/>bringen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begegnet</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darumben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuond</unclear> wir uns
<lb n="14"/>gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> unnd den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwerigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnößisch</unclear> fründtlich be-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dancken</unclear>, unnd unns erbieten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllches</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jeder</unclear> gelegen-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bests</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müglichisten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">flyßes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoerwidernen</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebeschulden</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mitt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlicher</unclear> bitt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> wöllent inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllich</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">em</unclear> Eydtgnößischen guoten willen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürbaß</unclear> beharren, unnd by
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwebenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gfahrlichnen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gschwinden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">löüffen</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>uff unns wyter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethrüwes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffsehen</unclear> haben, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzyt</unclear> zum besten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwyßen</unclear>, wie wir dann hieran
<lb n="22"/>gantz nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwyflend</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehingegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urpietig</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>sind, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ebenmeßig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear>, unnd uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürer</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guots</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>uffsehen zehalten, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> uff alle <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürfallenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> Eydt-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnößische</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thrüw</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> fründtschafft mit guotem willen
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerzeigen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deß</unclear> wir Gott bittend, das er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gliebts</unclear> vatterlandt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyter</unclear> inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ruow</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolstandt</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">under</unclear> synem schirm erhalten, unnd unns sambtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>übel gnedigklich bewahren wölle. Datum den
<lb n="30"/><origDate when="1621" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">28</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> Aprilis, anno 1621</origDate>.
<lb n="31"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>der statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2267_8598.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2267_8599.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2267_8600.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="33"/>Den frommen, fürsichtigen, ehr-
<lb n="34"/>samen wysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="35"/>und Rhat der Statt St: Gall-
<lb n="36"/>en</orgName>, unseren insonders guot-
<lb n="37"/>en fründten, und gethrüwen
<lb n="38"/>lieben Eydtgnossen.
</p>
